TiTTibho viTabhUtashcha saMhrAdashchendratApanaH.
daityadAnavasa~NghAshcha sarve ruchirakuNDalAH .. 2\-9\-19 (11656) 
sragviNo maulinashchaiva tathA divyaparichChadAH.
