la~NghatI gomatI chaiva sandhyA trisrotasI tathA.
etAshchanyAshcha rAjendra sutIrthA lokavishrutAH .. 2\-9\-27 (11664) 
saritaH sarvatashchAnyAstIrthAni cha sarAMsi cha.
