mahIdharA ratnavanto rasA ye cha pratiShThitAH .. 2\-9\-31 (11668) 
kathayantaH sumadhurAH kathAstatra samAsate.
vAruNashcha tathA mantrI sunAbhaH paryupAsate .. 2\-9\-32 (11669) 
