##Mahabharata - Sabha Parva - Chapter Text##

nArada uvAcha ..

pitAmahasabhAM tAta kathyamAnAM nibodha me.
shakyate yA na nirdeShTumevaMrUpeti bhArata .. 2\-11\-1 (11713) 
purA devayuge rAjannAdityo bhagavAndivaH.
