chaityakasya gireH shR^i~NgaM bhittvA kimiha sadmani.
advAreNa praviShTAH stha nirbhayA rAjakilviShAt .. 2\-21\-52 (12185) 
vadadhvaM vAchi vIryaM cha brAhmaNasya visheShataH.
