##Mahabharata - Sabha Parva - Chapter Topics##
yudhiShThirasabhAyAM duryodhane nirjaladeshe jalabhrameNa paridhAnamutkarShati sati tathA sa jaladeshe sthalabhrAntyA bhavanadhAnagamanena jale patati cha sati bhImAdibhirupahAsaH .. 1\.. chintAtAntaM duryodhanaM prati shakuninA chintAhetuprashne duryodhanena tatkathana pUrvakaM dhR^itarAShTre svaduH shanivedanAya shakunimprati chodanam .. 2\..

##Mahabharata - Sabha Parva - Chapter Text##

vaishampAyana uvAcha ..

vasanduryodhanastasyAM sabhAyAM puruSharShabha.
