tulyAbhijanavIryashcha kathaM bhrAtuH shriyaM nR^ipa.
putra kAmayase mohAnmaivaM bhUH shAmya mA shuchaH .. 2\-80\-3 (14574) 
atha yaj~navibhUtiM tAM kA~NkShase bharatarShabha.
