tatastayA vR^itaM pArthaM dR^iShTvA sarve nR^ipAstadA.
roShAtsarvAyudhAngR^ihya kruddhA vIrA mahaujasaH. 
vaikartanaM puraskR^itya sarve pArthamupAdravan ..  2\-97\-5 (15262) 
